  "issue_era": {
    "ref": "977651396490b48ccf37fd2450de046689d2ecdd",
    "note": "The census as it stood when #1529 first shipped (9776513964) had three phase-A statements and no fixture_days. Its game CTE selected (id, sport_key) only; the current CTE adds home/away names and the UTC fixture day as projections, and market_rows groups by those game columns too. The WHERE/JOIN predicates (events completed/closed, commence_time >= NOW() - 30 days, inner join sports; every linked futures_market; LEFT JOIN futures_outcomes) are byte-identical, and the added game columns are functionally dependent on fm.event_id, so the game and market cohorts are unchanged. The statement hashes therefore differ; the cohort definition does not."
  },
